{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/113973-playing-around-with-the-witchtooth-kith","id":113973,"title":"Playing around with the Witchtooth Kith","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-16T04:56:57-07:00","id":113973,"title":"Playing around with the Witchtooth Kith","content":"Has anyone played with the parameters of the Witchtooth Kith. Basically is extra dice for a limited type of contract. I could see a Fairest useing a version of this to cast love spells instead of hexs. Charms of fertility, charms of healing, taking and giving luck, their are many simple themes for a power boost. Has anyone out there used Witchtooth this way?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T05:24:10-07:00","id":113981,"title":"","content":"It's certainly possible, but you'd want to make sure that the breadth of effect is about even. It's an abstract thing, and hard to balance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T06:34:24-07:00","id":114010,"title":"","content":"One possibility would be to allow the Witchtooth blessing to apply to everything that falls under the parameters for curses outlined in Dancers in the Dusk. The various Contracts, certainly, perhaps for activating appropriate Tokens or tricking people into Maledictions as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-17T08:31:48-07:00","id":114726,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HobbitGuy1420</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/113973-playing-around-with-the-witchtooth-kith?p=113981#post113981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's certainly possible, but you'd want to make sure that the breadth of effect is about even. It's an abstract thing, and hard to balance.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say that it was a Storyteller's call. But an extra die for a thematically appropriate type of contract seems right. Firehearts might want an extra die to control flame, that's as broad as cursing. If I create a Fox themed Beast useing the Coyote kith and use Witchtooth for darring tricks, again it's about as broad. There no hard and fast rule, you feel your way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-17T08:33:02-07:00","id":114728,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>espritdecalmar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/113973-playing-around-with-the-witchtooth-kith?p=114010#post114010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One possibility would be to allow the Witchtooth blessing to apply to everything that falls under the parameters for curses outlined in Dancers in the Dusk. The various Contracts, certainly, perhaps for activating appropriate Tokens or tricking people into Maledictions as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>I look that I and see how I like it. Thanks for the heads up.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}